2811 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Product\072 Nail salon booking \046 operations management system\nAudience\072 Customers and salon owners\nRole\072 Product Designer \050end\055to\055end MVP\051\nProblem\072 Nail salon operated manually\054 difficult to manage appointments\054 customer info\054 and staff data\056\nSolution\072\nResearch salon owner \046 customer needs\nBuild MVP including\072\nOnline booking \046 scheduling\nCustomer data management \050contacts\054 history\051\nStaff information management\nMini game Lucky Draw to boost engagement\nDesign internal Admin management system\nTech\072 Use AI to design and build MVP\nFront\055end\072 Figma Make\nBack\055end\072 Supabase\nStorage\072 Cloudinary\nOther services\072 Resend\nAI Chatbot\057API\072 Deepseek\054 Alibaba Cloud\nResults\nMVP deployed and operational\nIncreased professionalism in managing schedules \046 customer data\nSupported launch in a short timeframe \050March 27\02328\051)
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 2812 0 R
     /Pg 1966 0 R
     /S /Span
